   "source": [
    "### 1.5.2 Compare the Metropolis samples with the gridding-based approximation of the posterior"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4a7264ad",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$ prior : f_{prior}(\\theta) = f(\\alpha) \\cdot f(\\beta)  \\propto exp (-\\frac{\\alpha^2}{8} - \\frac{\\beta^2}{2}) \\\\\n",
    "likelihood : \\mathcal{L}(\\theta) = P(y | \\theta) = \\prod_{i=1}^{4} \\left[ \\binom{n_i}{y_i} p_i^{y_i} (1-p_i)^{n_i - y_i} \\right] \\\\\n",
    "posterior : f_{post}(\\theta) = f(\\theta | y) \\propto f_{prior}(\\theta) \\cdot \\mathcal{L}(\\theta)\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
